-- qr_182: the sūra names as a reader sees them — the vowelled Arabic name, the transliteration
-- with its long vowels and ʿayn, and the English meaning ("The Opening"). These used to be typed
-- into the iOS app (SurahData.swift); the app now reads /api/qr/surahs, so they live here.
